```

The component never writes a colour value, but the swatches read `--accent-myelin`, `--accent-emerald`, `--accent-amber` and `--accent-rose`. The token list only exposes the active accent as `--myelin`, so these four per-accent tokens (each with day and night values, taken from the accents table) need to be added to `styles.css` before the swatches show their true colours. The selected state's text sits on `--myelin-wash`, so check the `--ink` on `--myelin-wash` pair with `check_contrast` in both themes.

